# DAY orders rest like GTC and expire at the close; GTC orders survive it.
N 1 1 1 B LMT DAY 0 CN 99 5
N 2 2 2 B LMT GTC 0 CN 100 3
N 3 3 3 S LMT DAY 0 CN 105 2
N 4 4 4 S LMT GTC 0 CN 100 1
# A halt rejects new orders and replaces but accepts cancels; nothing expires.
S 5 HALTED
N 6 5 1 B LMT GTC 0 CN 98 1
R 7 2 100 1
C 8 3
S 9 CONTINUOUS
# Close: DAY order 1 expires; GTC order 2 stays.
S 10 CLOSED
N 11 6 1 B LMT GTC 0 CN 98 1
# CLOSED -> CONTINUOUS must go through PRE_OPEN.
S 12 CONTINUOUS
# Session open resets used ids, except those of orders still resting (2).
S 13 PRE_OPEN
N 14 7 1 B LMT GTC 0 CN 98 1
S 15 CONTINUOUS
N 16 4 1 B LMT GTC 0 CN 98 1
N 17 2 1 B LMT GTC 0 CN 98 1
